# Prettier owns TypeScript, JavaScript and JSON here, and nothing else.
#
# Markdown: prose reflowing is churn, and these READMEs ship to customers where a
# hand-chosen line break is sometimes deliberate.
*.md

# YAML: CloudFormation templates use flow mappings and nested !If structures that
# prettier reflows into something much harder to read, and cfn-lint plus
# actionlint already cover correctness.
*.yaml
*.yml

# Generated by examples/*/dev/build_dashboards.py, and a test asserts the
# committed JSON is byte-identical to what the generator emits. Letting prettier
# reformat them would put two formatters in charge of one file and fail that
# test on every run.
examples/*/dashboards/*.json
